1. She is a British VTuber. (Verbatim: "I'm Elias Delaria, British VTuber.")
2. She refers to herself as a paladin and uses a sword as part of her persona. (Verbatim: "I'm a paladin." / "You trust me with this blade. And with this blade I shall fight.")
3. She has a tendency to procrastinate and is not naturally tidy, despite her parents' efforts to teach her otherwise. (Verbatim: "I believe my parents really, really, really tried to make me into a tidy person. And they just didn't. They also tried to make me not into a procrastinator or all of that...")
4. She identifies with the Pokémon nature "scuff," indicating she sees herself as messy or imperfect by nature. (Verbatim: "If I was Pokemon, mine would definitely say scuff.")
5. She enjoys eating burgers, fries, and chicken nuggets. (Verbatim: "I got myself a burger. Um... And I got some fries. And I had some nuggets earlier.")
6. She has a fondness for the word "Koro" and expresses liking it. (Verbatim: "Koro好き!")
7. She likes wearing ponytails and feels she is currently embracing that style. (Verbatim: "I got a new ponytail! Yippee! I like ponytail. Yeah, I'm living my ponytail life now.")
8. She owns a katana prop or replica, but jokes about it being illegal in Britain. (Verbatim: "In Britain, no one can own a katana. Don't tell the police about this sword of mine, okay?")
9. She plans to do a big cleanup or personal "cleansing" to recover and redeem herself after periods of exhaustion. (Verbatim: "I need to give myself some time off soon so I can, like... redeem myself. I don't know how else to describe it. Do a big cleanse.")
10. She associates cozy environments with her streaming identity and values that aesthetic. (Verbatim: "Also my nice new room and my nice new cozy cozy time.") [end of text]



1. She previously worked as a software developer. (Verbatim: "i remember i got to do that as a developer as well")
